DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15393::$$$message_0118_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, Tohsaka?"::
15394::$$$message_0118_0001_0000$$$::I spot Tohsaka at the port that I stopped by during my walk.[lr]::
15395::$$$message_0118_0001_0001$$$::Tohsaka at the wharf is a rare combination.::
15396::$$$message_0118_0002_0000$$$::"Yo, Tohsaka...are you waiting for someone?"[lr]::
15397::$$$message_0118_0002_0001$$$::"...My fortune said, 'Excellent Luck: the person I'm waiting for will come even if they are late.'"[lr]::
15398::$$$message_0118_0002_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
15399::$$$message_0118_0002_0003$$$::"Oh, no, it's nothing. [cacheimage storage=凛私服05d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05d(中) textoff=0]Hello, Emiya. So, why did you think I was waiting for someone?"[lr]::
15400::$$$message_0118_0002_0004$$$::Tohsaka murmured something like fortune-telling just now.[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06b(中) textoff=0]::
15401::$$$message_0118_0003_0000$$$::"Well, you're at the port, right? I thought you might be waiting for either some luggage or a visitor."[lr]::
15402::$$$message_0118_0003_0001$$$::"This is a regional port. There aren't any eccentric visitors who would come directly."[lr]::
15403::$$$message_0118_0003_0002$$$::Yeah... But.::
15404::$$$message_0118_0004_0000$$$::"Kiritsugu departed abroad from here."[lr]::
15405::$$$message_0118_0004_0001$$$::"...No way, what kind of person was your dad... [cacheimage storage=凛私服08a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服08a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Oh, I see."::
15406::$$$message_0118_0005_0000$$$::"Your dad was... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06f(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服06f(中) time=300 textoff=0]Yeah, by going through the international airport, it's like asking to be found, so you would normally be smuggling yourself."[lr]::
15407::$$$message_0118_0005_0001$$$::"...That's some dangerous talk all of a sudden. I thought it was my old man's preference to use a boat."::
15408::$$$message_0118_0006_0000$$$::"No, mages don't waste anything in their actions. Even if it looks meaningless, there is some meaning... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服06b(中) time=300 textoff=0]Yeah, if you think of it that way, this port could be used too."[lr]::
15409::$$$message_0118_0006_0001$$$::Tohsaka nods with great interest.[lr]::
15410::$$$message_0118_0006_0002$$$::Am I going to end up having to watch over another departure from here?::
15411::$$$message_0118_0007_0000$$$::"Yeah... Airplane fares are expensive and a hassle."[lr]::
15412::$$$message_0118_0007_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
15413::$$$message_0118_0007_0002$$$::"I said, airfare, do you get it?[lr]::
15414::$$$message_0118_0007_0003$$$::A roundtrip to London is a lot, so even if you reserve it beforehand and get the cheapest plane ticket, it's still a lot. [cacheimage storage=凛私服05d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05d(中) textoff=0]If I'm able to, it makes me want to blend in with an off-season package tour and run away in the middle of it."::
15415::$$$message_0118_0008_0000$$$::When I hear Tohsaka's dangerous transportation plan, I'm at a loss for how I should interject.[lr]::
15416::$$$message_0118_0008_0001$$$::I get the vibe that she might actually do it, and the fact that she might not be picky about how she could get even a one yen discount scares me.::
15417::$$$message_0118_0009_0000$$$::"It's not good to do things that cause people trouble like that."[lr]::
15418::$$$message_0118_0009_0001$$$::I bet the tour guide woman would cry.[lr]::
15419::$$$message_0118_0009_0002$$$::"I know. When I go over there, I get mileage, but it makes me wonder just how much I would have to get to ride for free...[cacheimage storage=凛私服07a腕b(中),凛私服07a腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服07a腕b(中) textoff=0][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服07a腕a(中) textoff=0]so!"[lr]::
15420::$$$message_0118_0009_0003$$$::As if to say it's a good idea, a troubled Tohsaka says,::
15421::$$$message_0118_0010_0000$$$::"I was thinking it would be cheaper if I could go by boat from here."[lr]::
15422::$$$message_0118_0010_0001$$$::"...Tohsaka. I think a passenger boat would be way more expensive than going by plane."[lr]::
15423::$$$message_0118_0010_0002$$$::Because the number of days is fundamentally different.[lr]::
15424::$$$message_0118_0010_0003$$$::On top of that, a journey on a passenger boat is a luxury in this day and age.::
15425::$$$message_0118_0011_0000$$$::"Oh... That's right..."[lr]::
15426::$$$message_0118_0011_0001$$$::"Besides, my old man would board fishing boats or cargo ships."[lr]::
15427::$$$message_0118_0011_0002$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服10c(中) textoff=0][say storage=cty0308_rin_0110 name=凛]That's a good idea, [cacheimage storage=凛私服08a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服08a(中) time=300 textoff=0]it would be killing two birds with one stone if I make you work on a fishing boat and send you to London..."[lr]::
15428::$$$message_0118_0011_0003$$$::"Hold on. That's not possible."[lr]::
15429::$$$message_0118_0011_0004$$$::Can she stop casually talking about things like sending me off to work long hours on a fishing boat?[lr]::
15430::$$$message_0118_0011_0005$$$::Also, can she stop being so serious about it?::
15431::$$$message_0118_0012_0000$$$::"No way! I thought it was a good idea!"[lr]::
15432::$$$message_0118_0012_0001$$$::"...I'm the one that should be surprised.[lr]::
15433::$$$message_0118_0012_0002$$$::First of all, wouldn't it take like half a year to get there if I do that?"::
15434::$$$message_0118_0013_0000$$$::"...I overlooked that. All that's left is a cargo ship or riding as a stowaway..."[lr]::
15435::$$$message_0118_0013_0001$$$::"Please get away from the idea of being a stowaway. If I'm going with you, I want to go normally. I can at least work and save up for my own flight."::
15436::$$$message_0118_0014_0000$$$::"...[lr]::
15437::$$$message_0118_0014_0001$$$::I take what I said back, I'll cover the travel cost.[lr]::
15438::$$$message_0118_0014_0002$$$::I'm the one taking you anyway. It would be pathetic if I don't do that much to take care of you as your mentor."::
15439::$$$message_0118_0015_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
15440::$$$message_0118_0015_0001$$$::She rephrases it, as if she's regretful about something.[lr]::
15441::$$$message_0118_0015_0002$$$::...Mrgh. It seems like that struck a chord with Tohsaka.::
15442::$$$message_0118_0016_0000$$$::"...I was being thoughtless.[lr]::
15443::$$$message_0118_0016_0001$$$::I should leave that kind of urgent mode of transportation as a trump card for when I get sloppy and end up being interrogated."[lr]::
15444::$$$message_0118_0016_0002$$$::"Please do that. Rather than a fishing boat or a cargo ship, I want to have a normal and luxurious trip if possible."[lr]::
15445::$$$message_0118_0016_0003$$$::...Even while saying that, I bet we'd be cramped in economy class if we were to go to London together.[lr]::
15446::$$$message_0118_0016_0004$$$::Business class would be a distant dream, let alone first class.::
15447::$$$message_0118_0017_0000$$$::"...Yeah, if we're able to become successful and live comfortably."[lr]::
15448::$$$message_0118_0017_0001$$$::Tohsaka makes a grand gesture and then suddenly...[lr]::
15449::$$$message_0118_0017_0002$$$::"Going on a leisurely cruise together also wouldn't be bad."[lr]::
15450::$$$message_0118_0017_0003$$$::"Sounds luxurious. This is because we're on a budget, huh?"::
15451::$$$message_0118_0018_0000$$$::"Maybe. Let's cut down and endure a frugal life until then.[lr]::
15452::$$$message_0118_0018_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服04c(中) time=300 textoff=0]Imagining that we're going to hang out under the Caribbean sun in seats that make our legs go numb."[lr]::
15453::$$$message_0118_0018_0002$$$::What a dream.[lr]::
15454::$$$message_0118_0018_0003$$$::A luxurious liner, sailing on a massive yacht and resort... To be honest, it's too luxurious to even imagine.::
15455::$$$message_0118_0019_0000$$$::"We can only work hard now for that, Emiya."[lr]::
15456::$$$message_0118_0019_0001$$$::"Got it, I'll do my best so that I can take you on a vacation."[lr]::
15457::$$$message_0118_0019_0002$$$::"Well, I'll probably be taking you before that."[lr]::
15458::$$$message_0118_0019_0003$$$::It's a difficult task, but it's worth the effort...huh.[lr]::
15459::$$$message_0118_0019_0004$$$::[se volume=60 storage=se545.wav]In the middle of talking about such a dream, the sea breeze starts blowing.::
15460::$$$message_0118_0020_0000$$$::"The wind is getting strong again.[lr]::
15461::$$$message_0118_0020_0001$$$::...I just came here to hang out, but what about you? Are you going to fish or something?"[lr]::
15462::$$$message_0118_0020_0002$$$::"No, I don't have any reason to be here. Why don't we go back to Shinto?"[lr]::
15463::$$$message_0118_0020_0003$$$::"Yeah... Oh, I have some shopping to do. [cacheimage storage=凛私服03g(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服03g(中) time=300 textoff=0]Keep me company, Emiya."::
15464::$$$message_0118_0021_0000$$$::By keeping her company, does she mean holding her things at Shinto?[lr]::
15465::$$$message_0118_0021_0001$$$::That much is a piece of cake.[lr]::
15466::$$$message_0118_0021_0002$$$::"Got it, [cacheimage storage=凛私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01b(中) textoff=0]I'll keep you company no matter where we go..."::

